      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s like i’m just watching a recording of myself go through the motions. the person everyone actually cared about... the version of me that actually mattered... she’s been gone for months. i’m just a ghost walking around in her skin now. it’s so exhausting pretending to be her.",
